      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "The Agricultural Feast takes place after Independence Day. It is not a worldwide celebration. Only Christians in Mexico look forward to its arrival for its religious origin.",
        "zh": "农业盛宴在独立日之后举行。它不是一个全世界都庆祝的节日。由于其宗教渊源，只有墨西哥的基督徒期待它的到来。",
